        <p class="photographer-intro__languages">We can plan and shoot in <strong>English, Italian or Russian.</strong></p>
        <a class="photography-link" href="#posing-guide">Take a look at the posing guide <i class="ph ph-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
      </div>
    </div>
